BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:21st Annual Kelly Brush Ride
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260912
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260913
DTSTAMP:20260910T150255Z
UID:51249a08a3ec6cb4fd182e0000ca63@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:The 21st Annual Kelly Brush Ride\, powered by Union Mutual\, i
 s back! This incredible fundraising event brings our community together to
  help make active lives possible for people with spinal cord injuries and 
 to improve safety for ski racers on course. Whether you’re an experience
 d cyclist or just getting started\, the Kelly Brush Ride is a fun day you 
 won’t want to miss! Join us by riding from Middlebury on one of our scen
 ic supported road routes or our 30-mile gravel route. Can’t make it? Rid
 e from Anywhere with our remote option! Choose your own route and join us 
 anytime until October 24. Prices vary by age group and registration date\n
 \nSources: Vermont.com\, Vermont Public
LOCATION:Alumni Stadium\, Middlebury College\, Vermont\, 14 Old Chapel Rd
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/21st-annua
 l-kelly-brush-ride-02-06-2026-16-22-26
