 cers Circle The Transmitter | A behind-the-scenes newsletter exclusively f
 or active members\, sent the first Tues But Why Fan Club | Activity Newsle
 tter exclusively for active members of the But Why Fan Club\, sent Other F
 undraising Emails | Matching challenges\, prize drawings and more\, sent p
 eriodically Audience Emails Program Schedules | Full TV listings for all c
